# A Treasure sacrificed for the repeat payment is not a card, even before state-based actions remove it from the graveyard.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mishra's Bauble
Gold Pan
Forgotten Lore
Forest x16
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mishra's Bauble.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mishra's Bauble.Activate(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Gold Pan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Forgotten Lore.Cast(Bot2)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot2.Choose(Black Lotus)
Bot1.Battlefield.Treasure Token.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.PayCost
! Bot2.Choose(Treasure Token)
Bot2.Choose(Mishra's Bauble)
Bot1.Decline
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Forgotten Lore; Black Lotus
